     A* Literals, hexadecimal constants, continuation, and enumerated
     A* keyword values.
     A* Member: LFCONST   Compilable: yes (given PERSON)
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for physical and logical files,
     A*   keyword entries. Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
00010A          R PERSFMT                   PFILE(PERSON)
     A*
     A* Quoted literals. A doubled apostrophe represents a single one.
00020A            NOTES                     TEXT('Free form notes')
00030A            OWNER                     TEXT('Customer''s own reference')
00040A            AGE                       COLHDG('Age' 'Years')
     A*
     A* + continues a literal, discarding leading blanks.
00050A            LONGTEXT                  TEXT('A description that runs +
00060A                                      across two source lines')
     A* - continues a literal, preserving leading blanks.
00070A            KEEPSPACE                 TEXT('PRESERVED    -
00080A                                           SPACING')
     A* A comment line may also sit inside the literal itself.
00082A            SPLITTXT                  TEXT('first half of-
     A* a comment between the two halves
     A                                      the literal')
     A* A sign may also continue between parameter values rather than
     A* inside a literal, and a comment line may interrupt the two halves.
00085A            AGE2                      COLHDG('Age' +
00086A                                             'Years')
00087A            HEXCMP2                   COMP(EQ -
     A* this comment sits between the two halves
     A                                      X'F1F2F3')
     A*
     A* Hexadecimal constants.
00090A            HEXCMP                    COMP(EQ X'F1F2F3')
00100A          S STATE                     VALUES(X'C1C2' X'C3C4')
     A*
     A* EDTCDE: 1-4, A-D, J-Q, W-Z, plus 5-9 user-defined.
00110A          R EDITS                     PFILE(PERSON)
00120A            EDT1                      EDTCDE(1)
00130A            EDT2                      EDTCDE(2)
00140A            EDT3                      EDTCDE(3)
00150A            EDT4                      EDTCDE(4)
00160A            EDT5                      EDTCDE(5)
00170A            EDT6                      EDTCDE(6)
00180A            EDT7                      EDTCDE(7)
00190A            EDT8                      EDTCDE(8)
00200A            EDT9                      EDTCDE(9)
00210A            EDTA                      EDTCDE(A)
00220A            EDTB                      EDTCDE(B)
00230A            EDTC                      EDTCDE(C)
00240A            EDTD                      EDTCDE(D)
00250A            EDTJ                      EDTCDE(J)
00260A            EDTK                      EDTCDE(K)
00270A            EDTL                      EDTCDE(L)
00280A            EDTM                      EDTCDE(M)
00290A            EDTN                      EDTCDE(N)
00300A            EDTO                      EDTCDE(O)
00310A            EDTP                      EDTCDE(P)
00320A            EDTQ                      EDTCDE(Q)
00330A            EDTW                      EDTCDE(W)
00340A            EDTX                      EDTCDE(X)
00350A            EDTY                      EDTCDE(Y)
00360A            EDTZ                      EDTCDE(Z)
     A*
     A* REFSHIFT: A, X, W, N, I, D, M for character fields;
     A* S, Y, N, I, D for numeric fields.
00370A          R SHIFTS                    PFILE(PERSON)
00380A            SHIFTA                    REFSHIFT(A)
00390A            SHIFTD                    REFSHIFT(D)
00400A            SHIFTI                    REFSHIFT(I)
00410A            SHIFTM                    REFSHIFT(M)
00420A            SHIFTN                    REFSHIFT(N)
00430A            SHIFTS                    REFSHIFT(S)
00440A            SHIFTW                    REFSHIFT(W)
00450A            SHIFTX                    REFSHIFT(X)
00460A            SHIFTY                    REFSHIFT(Y)
     A*
     A* CHECK edit-check codes. More than one may be given.
00470A          R CHECKS                    PFILE(PERSON)
00480A            CHKAB                     CHECK(AB)
00490A            CHKME                     CHECK(ME)
00500A            CHKMF                     CHECK(MF)
00510A            CHKM10                    CHECK(M10)
00520A            CHKM11                    CHECK(M11)
00530A            CHKVN                     CHECK(VN)
00540A            CHKVNE                    CHECK(VNE)
00550A            CHKMULTI                  CHECK(M10 VN)
     A* CHECK accepts a list, so every code in it must be matched.
09000A            CHK3                      CHECK(AB M10 VN)
09010A            CHK4                      CHECK(ME MF VNE M11)
